            "speaker_id": 142396,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team! Kicking off the Eco-Finance Awareness Week project. I've created a first draft of the concept note, you can find it here: A1. Please take a look and share your thoughts on the main objectives and key messages. My main task is T1, so your feedback is crucial. Let's get this aligned by EOD tomorrow. @all",
