            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 85956,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Looks like a solid start. On page 2, the message about 'investment strategies' might be a bit too strong. We should probably soften it to 'financial planning tips' to stay aligned with our Compliance Guidelines A3. This will also help frame my work on T2, defining the mini-session topics.",
