            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 142396,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point. I think we should aim for both. Let's say 70% existing customers who can benefit from cross-promotion, and 30% new local residents. What do you all think?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 142396,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Excellent catch, I agree. 'Financial planning tips' is much better. I'll make that change. It's critical we get the tone right from the start.",
