            "text": "Okay, I've updated A1 with all the feedback. Here's a summary of the proposed final key messages:\n1. 'Smart Savings, Green Future': Connecting financial health with environmental responsibility.\n2. 'Your Community Hub': Highlighting our integrated postal, banking, and bakery services.\n3. 'Sustainable Choices, Daily Impact': Showcasing eco-friendly options, including our locally-sourced bakery products.\n\nIf everyone is happy with this, we can approve the overall objective and messages.",
            "mentions": [],
